        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>蒙台梭利Montessori</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #2b2b2b;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #171717 0%, #1d1d1d 45%, #6d6a63 48%, #7a746b 100%);\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  /* background photo placeholder sits behind the text */\n  .placeholder.bg {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 720px;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.18);\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.28);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n    z-index: 0;\n  }\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    padding: 24px 18px 10px 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 6px 0 26px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, #f5f024 62%, #f5f024 96%, transparent 96%);\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .wavy {\n    text-decoration: underline wavy #f5f024;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\n    text-underline-offset: 4px;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 372px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.20);\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder bg\">[Photo: full-page background — child's face at top, wooden Montessori materials and shelves across the lower half]</figure>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h1>蒙台梭利Montessori</h1>\n\n      <p>蒙特梭利教学法并非一成不变，这种教学法是开放的，<br>\n      且建立在蒙特梭利教育哲学和精神之上。</p>\n\n      <p>非常强调环境对儿童的影响，</p>\n\n      <p>主张理想的教室必须具备以下五种要素<span class=\"hl\">：</span></p>\n      <p><span class=\"hl\">主张理想的教室必须具备以下五种要素：</span></p>\n\n      <p class=\"section\">1、自由的观念</p>\n\n      <p>●儿童只有在自由、开放的环境下才能将学习发挥到极点</p>\n\n      <p>●蒙特梭利并不赞同没有经过过滤的自由。</p>\n\n      <p>●儿童可以依照自己的兴趣选择教具，</p>\n\n      <p>也可以依照自己的喜好选择学习的地点及时间。</p>\n\n      <p><span class=\"hl\">●孩子之间可以相互观摩学习，是一种混龄式的教学。</span></p>\n\n      <p><span class=\"wavy\">●废除传统教学中惯用的奖惩制度</span></p>\n\n      <p class=\"section\">2、结构与秩序</p>\n\n      <p>●将教具按照其难度加以排列，<span class=\"hl\">较有秩序及结构感。</span></p>\n\n      <p>●养成儿童自动自发，<span class=\"wavy\">物归原处的生活习惯。</span></p>\n\n      <p>●外在环境的结构只是为配合儿童的学习，</p>\n\n      <p>教师们应视儿童的需要而适时更换教室的陈设，</p>\n\n      <p>在有序中保持弹性。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\">[illegible]</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
